WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.400
<b>This is the real Trainer Portal, shown with demo-only data. Home gives you your tier, weekly hours, client counts, and conversion performance.</b>

00:09.790 --> 00:13.743
<b>Retention flags clients needing contact, bookings, or program updates.</b>

00:13.743 --> 00:17.443
<b>Messages tracks weekly outreach and gives you guided check-in prompts.</b>

00:18.472 --> 00:22.272
<b>Programs lets you select a client and build or update their plan.</b>

00:22.678 --> 00:29.678
<b>Health Score brings training, engagement, and progress into one view, so you can spot risk early and choose the right next action.</b>

00:31.583 --> 00:34.766
<b>Every screen here uses isolated fake demo data.</b>
